#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:1
#: 0bedb29aee194c80b4efaffd069a2e3f
#
msgid "DFT-D3 修正（DFT D3）"
msgstr "DFT-D3 Correction (DFT D3)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:3
#: dad0e5694e5b47469c7e5d2330de6cea
msgid "界面按钮：`DFT D3`。"
msgstr "Toolbar action: `DFT D3`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:5
#: 263251bf08e14226adc3dd45e4038dbf
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:7
#: b41d73d232ed4ebfb0b5965de088d7ce
msgid ""
"计算 DFT-D3 色散修正，并按所选模式加到或从当前能量、力和 virial 中扣除。 适合统一训练数据是否包含 D3 "
"的标签约定，不是用于随意改善散点图。"
msgstr ""
"Calculate the DFT-D3 dispersion correction and either add it to or "
"subtract it from the current energies, forces, and virials. Use this to "
"make the training data follow one consistent convention on whether D3 is "
"included—not to cosmetically improve a scatter plot."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:11
#: 99501279f989468695e7e8b5829b19f7
msgid "DFT-D3 计算仅支持 CPU。即使 NEP 后端选择了 GPU，执行这项操作时也会改用 CPU。"
msgstr ""
"DFT-D3 calculation is CPU-only. This operation uses the CPU even when the"
" NEP backend is set to GPU."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:14
#: cf1952b86557470eaf043b8d1a2c47ca
msgid "修正原理"
msgstr "Correction Principle"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:16
#: 8c834778c7d04e9e962b9376409598be
msgid ""
"DFT-D3 用元素、原子间距和配位环境计算经验色散能 $E_{\\mathrm{D3}}$，并由其对坐标和 应变的导数得到力 $\\mathbf"
" F_{\\mathrm{D3}}$ 与 virial $\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}}$。本工具不重新做 "
"DFT，只对已有标签执行一致的加减："
msgstr ""
"DFT-D3 evaluates the empirical dispersion energy $E_{\\mathrm{D3}}$ from "
"the elements, interatomic distances, and coordination environments. Its "
"coordinate and strain derivatives give the forces $\\mathbf "
"F_{\\mathrm{D3}}$ and virial $\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}}$. This tool does "
"not rerun DFT; it applies a consistent addition or subtraction to the "
"existing labels:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:20
#: ab8e63160bc04e44835744d453f54f3c
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E' &= E+sE_{\\mathrm{D3}},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf F'_i &= \\mathbf F_i+s\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{D3},i},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf W' &= \\mathbf W+s\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"s=\\begin{cases}+1,&\\text{加上}\\\\-1,&\\text{减去。}\\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E' &= E+sE_{\\mathrm{D3}},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf F'_i &= \\mathbf F_i+s\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{D3},i},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf W' &= \\mathbf W+s\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"s=\\begin{cases}+1,&\\text{add}\\\\-1,&\\text{subtract}.\\end{cases}\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:30
#: 9ac004b1e5024d32b480a04c27867042
msgid ""
"`交换-相关泛函`决定 D3 阻尼参数，必须与原始 DFT 泛函一致；`D3 截断半径`控制色散原子对， "
"`配位数截断半径`控制配位环境计算，两者单位均为 Å。截断半径不是“精度越大越好”的普通滑块： "
"增大会提高计算量，也可能改变与原始标签约定的一致性。"
msgstr ""
"The `Exchange-correlation functional` selects the D3 damping parameters "
"and must match the functional used for the original DFT calculation. `D3 "
"cutoff radius` limits dispersion pairs, while `Coordination-number cutoff"
" radius` limits coordination-environment evaluation; both are in Å. These"
" cutoffs are not ordinary accuracy sliders: increasing them costs more "
"and can also change consistency with the original labeling convention."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:34
#: 366b17b928a94aa8bd4bedcc581ad6db
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7818
#: 33ab3a442d2f4b7e99337d08ccbf0e4c
msgid "输入控件：`交换-相关泛函`、`D3 截断半径`、`配位数截断半径`和`修正方式（加上/减去）`。"
msgstr ""
"Controls: `Exchange-correlation functional`, `D3 cutoff radius`, "
"`Coordination-number cutoff radius`, and the correction mode (`Add` or "
"`Subtract`)."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7819
#: 8ed75fdb3cae4ff09bdf60ff5d28cb6b
msgid "执行结果：后台应用 DFT-D3 修正并重绘。"
msgstr ""
"Result: apply the DFT-D3 correction in the background and redraw the "
"plots."

